00:01:42.497 --> 00:01:45.063
You know, if you really
have been responsible,

00:01:45.097 --> 00:01:48.230
responsibly hurt somebody else's feelings,

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:49.930
it's your fault.

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:54.097
And to think about that and think about
the effect on the other person,

